From: NxLauncher maintainers
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Clip Metal texture view mip ranges to available levels

Temporary local carry of the verified repair from
nxnative-echoes-fix-20261022 at 951d6ff918dfd68dbdcb76dac6e2eaf0a191eb45.
Reject a base outside the texture and clip the requested count to the
remaining levels. Include the production Metal regression (34 checks).
Local only; this patch does not authorize upstream publication.
No game profiles, game files, fonts, or generated assets are included.

---
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m         |  5 ++++-
 dm/gfx/tests/Makefile        |  5 ++++-
 dm/gfx/tests/t_view_levels.m | 43 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

